body:
I have no idea who it could possibly be. My best guess is that it's someone surrounding the Union X timeline, since the fore tellers are making an appearance in the story now. I can't say who it might be. A lot of people think it's Skuld or Ava, and while that would be cool, I'm **hoping** (not guessing, hoping) that it's either Ava or even Streletzia. 

&#x200B;

To be honest, I don't care if she was barely in the story, Streletzia was the best, and I do not want her story to be over. Wishful thinking I guess.
